Z||000005||Raydar||11-26-2000||02:37 PM||||Josh,<P>Try Ed Parks at the Fiero Factory...<BR> <A HREF="http://welcome.to/thefierofactory" TARGET=_blank>http://welcome.to/thefierofactory</A> <P>He's just North of Huntsville Ala. He'll have everything you need. Last I heard, he was getting about a grand for Getrags, though. You might try an Isuzu (came with 85 and later 4 cyl.) 5-speed. Lot of folks have used 'em with the V-6 with good results. Ed will sell you the parts, or do the conversion for you. (Not inexpensive though. He'll probably try to talk you out of it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ) <P>Raydar||||reg||1
